# CarboxMol Bioinformatics Club - Cursor AI Rules
# Reference: PROJECT_AI_RULES.md

- Strictly maintain 100% responsiveness across all viewports (320px to 4K+) with zero horizontal overflow.
- Ensure strict bilingual parity between Azerbaijani (AZ) and English (EN) via js/i18n.js. Switching language must NEVER break navbar or button geometry.
- Keep SEO, canonical links, OpenGraph, and Schema.org JSON-LD synchronized via js/seo-responsive-engine.js.
- Ensure the Exit/Logout button and Portal Capsule in the header never spill outside the viewport on any screen width (especially 1280px MacBook Air).
- Always sync changes between CarboxMol-Bioinformatics-Club.github.io and CarboxMol-Bioinformatics-Club.
